  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2019900,
      "startingMessageId": [
        201990000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "201990000": {
          "id": 201990000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}阁下，打扰了",
          "next": [
            201990001
          ]
        },
        "201990001": {
          "id": 201990001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "阁下还记得我养的两只小奇美拉吗？我发现它们很喜欢听着童话故事入眠",
          "next": [
            201990002
          ]
        },
        "201990002": {
          "id": 201990002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "最近想开拓一些写作的新思路，因此我正打算试写一篇",
          "next": [
            201990003,
            201990004
          ]
        },
        "201990003": {
          "id": 201990003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "这次是什么样的新故事？",
          "next": [
            201990006
          ]
        },
        "201990004": {
          "id": 201990004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "有我的戏份吗？",
          "next": [
            201990005
          ]
        },
        "201990005": {
          "id": 201990005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "可以有",
          "next": [
            201990006
          ]
        },
        "201990006": {
          "id": 201990006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "其实正打算问问阁下的意见，目前的构思是：",
          "next": [
            201990007
          ]
        },
        "201990007": {
          "id": 201990007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "主人公意外进入了一座小镇，镇里住着猫咪和小鼠，会唱歌的乌鸦，粉粉的小猪，和齐心协力的蚂蚁家族",
          "next": [
            201990008
          ]
        },
        "201990008": {
          "id": 201990008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "它们很通人性，喜欢和主人公一起玩耍，也很喜欢听故事",
          "next": [
            201990009
          ]
        },
        "201990009": {
          "id": 201990009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "不，是非常，非常喜欢……",
          "next": [
            201990010
          ]
        },
        "201990010": {
          "id": 201990010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "当童话镇进入深夜，一切都安静下来…小动物们却睡不着……",
          "next": [
            201990011
          ]
        },
        "201990011": {
          "id": 201990011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "「这里不能安静」，「这里不能安静」，它们说……",
          "next": [
            201990012
          ]
        },
        "201990012": {
          "id": 201990012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "于是，它们来到主人公的床边",
          "next": [
            201990013
          ]
        },
        "201990013": {
          "id": 201990013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "就这样",
          "next": [
            201990014
          ]
        },
        "201990014": {
          "id": 201990014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "●_●",
          "next": [
            201990015
          ]
        },
        "201990015": {
          "id": 201990015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "◕_◕",
          "next": [
            201990016
          ]
        },
        "201990016": {
          "id": 201990016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "◐‿◑",
          "next": [
            201990017
          ]
        },
        "201990017": {
          "id": 201990017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "看着你",
          "next": [
            201990018,
            201990021,
            201990024
          ]
        },
        "201990018": {
          "id": 201990018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "是这么个「童话」故事？那么吓人？",
          "next": [
            201990019
          ]
        },
        "201990019": {
          "id": 201990019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "啊，果然很恐怖吗？",
          "next": [
            201990020
          ]
        },
        "201990020": {
          "id": 201990020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "不瞒你说，我写着写着才发现，可能这个题材更适合恐怖小说",
          "next": [
            201990027
          ]
        },
        "201990021": {
          "id": 201990021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "别说，还挺萌的",
          "next": [
            201990022
          ]
        },
        "201990022": {
          "id": 201990022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "不瞒你说，我写着写着才发现，可能这个题材更适合恐怖小说",
          "next": [
            201990023
          ]
        },
        "201990023": {
          "id": 201990023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "但从阁下的反应来看，恐怖元素恐怕还不够",
          "next": [
            201990027
          ]
        },
        "201990024": {
          "id": 201990024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "那么哪里可以安静？",
          "next": [
            201990025
          ]
        },
        "201990025": {
          "id": 201990025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "果然，阁下的关注点总是如此与众不同",
          "next": [
            201990026
          ]
        },
        "201990026": {
          "id": 201990026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "不瞒你说，我写着写着才发现，可能这个题材更适合恐怖小说",
          "next": [
            201990027
          ]
        },
        "201990027": {
          "id": 201990027,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "next": [
            201990028
          ]
        },
        "201990028": {
          "id": 201990028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "但我对恐怖小说涉猎不深，为了更有代入感，也找了一些参考书，比如《未解谜案20件》《消失的诸因》……",
          "next": [
            201990029
          ]
        },
        "201990029": {
          "id": 201990029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "今天刚读完《好好吃饭》，感觉有一些不错的点子",
          "next": [
            201990030
          ]
        },
        "201990030": {
          "id": 201990030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "等我有进度之后，再来和阁下交流",
          "next": [
            201990031
          ]
        },
        "201990031": {
          "id": 201990031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "text": "放心吧，小奇美拉们也会天天催稿，它们最爱听故事了",
          "next": [
            201990032
          ]
        },
        "201990032": {
          "id": 201990032,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1407,
          "next": []
        }
      },
